{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53172","headline":"送最澄上人还日本国 · 幻梦","name":"送最澄上人还日本国","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"劫（疑「却」）返扶桑路，还乘旧叶船。\n上潮看浸日，翻浪欲陷（日本甲本注：「陷，应作滔。\n」）天。\n求宿宁逾日（日本甲本注：「日，疑月。\n」），云行讵隔年？\n远将乾竺法，归去化生缘。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"幻梦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53172.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53172","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}